{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46432","headline":"竹里作六韵 · 齐己","name":"竹里作六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我来深处坐，剩觉有吟思。\n忽似潇湘岸，欲生风雨时。\n冷烟蒙古屋，乾箨堕秋墀。\n径熟因频入，身闲得徧欹。\n踏多鞭节损，题乱粉痕隳。\n犹见前山叠，微茫隔短篱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}